{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n こんばんは\n \n \n 今日も１日お疲れ様です。\n \n \n 今日から4月ですね🌸\n \n \n あちこちで桜を見ては\n 「春だ～～～」と幸福感で満たされています。\n \n \n 毎年、桜を見るだけで\n 心が浄化されていくような、\n 清々しく、心地よく、穏やかな気持ちになるので\n \n \n 桜の力ってすごいな～、と感じます。\n \n \n 少しでも桜が満開な瞬間を\n 多く見れたらな‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n -\n \n \n 昨日、「思ったより寂しくない」のMVが\n 公開されました。‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n 観てくださる皆さんと同じ空間にいるような、そして一緒に楽しんでいただけるような\n MVになっています。\n \n \n 撮影があっという間に感じてしまうくらい、\n ずっと楽しい時間だったな～‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0JNMYP932RZX7GPWSWVC09","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0JNQERJTM8TKEA21P80ENG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0JNTK0JVR01FKE7P0618M5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0JNXK4SZTG1DS5ZXBSPPPJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0JP02TZTBSB1ZJ17B7BHZF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0JP367VAZ74RDE0NT63F3X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n では。\n \n \n \n 本日の音楽。\n \n \n マルシィさん / ワスレナグサ\n \n \n みい。             "}],"source":"archive"}